        "title": "Calculate Second Term",
        "text": "Calculate $$\\cos 45° \\cdot \\sin 30°$$:\n$$= \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$$\n\nEnter as: sqrt(2)/4",
